  Alternatives that fix staging without touching prod:

  - Make [38;5;153mverify[39m an env-driven module-level value (e.g. [38;5;153mREPORTS_VERIFY_TLS=0[39m set only in [38;5;153msync_staging.py[39m), so prod keeps
    verifying.
  - Point [38;5;153mverify[39m at the staging CA bundle path ([38;5;153mrequests[39m accepts a path), which keeps verification on everywhere.
  - Set [38;5;153mverify=False[39m unconditionally as asked, accepting it applies to prod too.
